<title>USA: Giant Food Inc Q4 sales hurt by strike.</title>
<headline>Giant Food Inc Q4 sales hurt by strike.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Giant Food Inc said on Tuesday its fourth-quarter earnings were hurt by the five-week Teamsters Local 639 strike.</p>
<p>Actual results will be released on March 25, but the now-settled strike did cut into sales, the company said.</p>
<p>Also lowering the company's sales was the improved weather this winter as compared with last year, the company said. The bad weather boosted sales.</p>
</text>
